# Cursor AI Agent ignore file
#
# Goal: keep Cursor responsive on a 97 MB / 1.4k-file static-site repo
# WITHOUT hiding the source files an agent needs to actually work on.
#
# The previous version of this file excluded all *.html, all *.js (except
# two), and all of projects/ — which effectively made Cursor blind to the
# codebase. That has been narrowed to the genuinely heavy stuff: binary
# assets, generated artifacts, and a few oversized research dirs the
# agent rarely needs to read.

# --- Binary assets (large, opaque to Cursor) ---------------------------------
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.JPG
*.JPEG
*.gif
*.webp
*.avif
*.ico
*.pdf
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.weights
*.h5
*.onnx
*.pt
*.mp4
*.mov

# --- Generated / vendored ----------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Heavy archival research dirs (rarely edited day-to-day) -----------------
# Mostly large PDFs + generated visualizations. Uncomment to re-include
# if you start editing them.
thermal-modeling-files/
quantum-memory-files/
metamaterials-files/
duv-files/
neuromorphic-files/
orion-files/
vertical-gan-files/
silicon-photonics-files/
pcm-gst-research/
photolithography-simulation/

# --- Notebooks (often huge JSON blobs) ---------------------------------------
*.ipynb

# --- Logs / dataset dumps -----------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.csv
*.mac
*.sql
*.tmp
*.temp
